  "review": "The changed Claude hooks reference still distinguishes before/after-tool events and task/subagent decision powers (OBS-ADH-013). New notes record that FileChanged is after-effect and that internal agents can produce SubagentStop. These limit what a hook log can prove. REQ-ADH-009/022 and POL-ADH-003 already require actual runtime capability evidence; no new mandatory clause is introduced.",
